  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Immortal Crane Sect elites bound for Fairy Bai Hu’s inheritance are told the lord Gu Immortals of the sects have agreed not to strike and will send elite disciples to compete fairly instead. The same briefing names Heavenly Lotus Sect, Spirit Butterfly Valley, Ancient Soul Sect, Heaven’s Envy Sect, and the rest of Central Continent’s peer forces as co-competitors, and says Immortal Crane Sect must stay united on the trip.",
      "chapters": [
        335
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "place-in-the-ten-sect-contest",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_immortal_crane_sect",
        "inh_hu_immortal_inheritance",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "fac_heavenly_lotus_sect",
        "loc_spirit_butterfly_valley",
        "fac_ancient_soul_sect",
        "reg_central_continent"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Zheng tells Lord Sky Crane that he has heard of Wei Wu Shang in Immortal Crane Sect: a healing Gu Master, a rising star in Heaven’s Envy Sect, a strong A grade aptitude genius most skilled at healing himself and often leaving unscathed after battle. Immortal Crane elite disciples shout for Fang Zheng to defeat “this sissy from Heaven’s Envy Sect,” and Wei Wu Shang is the leader of the elite disciples Heaven’s Envy Sect sent this time.",
      "chapters": [
        339
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "wei-wu-shang-at-tian-ti",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_zheng",
        "char_lord_sky_crane",
        "char_wei_wu_shang",
        "sys_gu_master"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In the spar, Wei Wu Shang represents Heaven’s Envy Sect as well as himself while Fairy Bi Xia watches. Lord Sky Crane warns Fang Zheng that Wei Wu Shang’s injury wind Gu is a terrifying trump card and that Heaven’s Envy Sect’s junior is not weak. After Wei Wu Shang’s primeval essence runs dry, Fang Zheng offers to call the match a draw, praising him as worthy of Heaven’s Envy Sect’s elite disciples, and Wei Wu Shang accepts that surface ending while privately promising to repay the leniency and to spar again later.",
      "chapters": [
        341
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "spar-outcome-and-injury-wind-gu",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fairy_bi_xia",
        "gu_injury_wind_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Central Continent Gu Immortals cut a path through the saint regional wall, Fairy Ao Xue and Fairy Ling Mei stand and speak for Heaven’s Envy Manor, then activate peerless crescent moon slash together. That move’s core is rank seven crescent moon Immortal Gu with two rank six Immortal Gu as support, and it needs two Gu Immortals to display its might. Chen Zhen Chi calls it a well-known killer move of Heaven’s Envy Manor after it cuts a seventy-six step opening.",
      "chapters": [
        710
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "cuts-open-the-regional-wall",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fairy_ao_xue",
        "char_fairy_ling_mei",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "char_chen_zhen_chi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fairy Ling Mei comes from Heaven’s Envy Manor. She and Fairy Ao Xue control rank seven crescent moon Gu and can unleash peerless crescent moon slash together, one of the manor’s signature famous killer moves.",
      "chapters": [
        923
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "cuts-open-the-regional-wall",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_crescent_moon_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "On a small island during that contest, a Heaven’s Envy Manor group of five includes Wei Wu Shang as head of the elite disciples representing the manor. The manor specially raises his cultivation from rank four middle stage to rank four peak stage for the resource contest, both to train the next generation and because it lacks manpower.",
      "chapters": [
        909
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "wei-wu-shang-among-later-elites",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When the group is trapped by lake waves and a desolate beast dragonfish, one Gu Master urges Elder Zhu Ning to use their immortal method as well, naming Heaven’s Envy Manor among the ten great ancient sects.",
      "chapters": [
        910
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "wei-wu-shang-among-later-elites",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
